c77ab8f1dcebec3cb21863b695ee1200f806e6148b64","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Time seems to warp and bend around this floating weapon.","source_tag":"_t","target":"时空在其周围扭曲。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5d5e25573b225ccab9315d71641c3bf2501d7aa640388fd92a44c88aba730607","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"992c9d6a81f72b8ea0ac61d47c08f954d6512d9cefc714adbc8d4a5dd737ffa0","logical_entry_identity":"71551ba0c00324f2b2419c28fe3d76185ad8966fdcea263bcd59fd341f268d9e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Water circles slowly on the ground around this naga's tail, some droplets leaping up now and then as if they are impatient to do their mistress' bidding. Her dark tail is coiled tight, making her look short, but her calm and confident stare assure you that she will not be easily overcome. As the water begins to rise around her the air starts to shimmer, and you feel her dark eyes are penetrating into you deeper than is comfortable.","source_tag":"_t","target":"水流缓慢地围绕着这位娜迦的尾巴旋转，有些水珠不时跃起，似乎迫不及待要执行主人的命令。她黑色的尾巴蜷缩起来，使她看起来较为矮小，但是她沉着而自信的眼神让你确信她不是轻易就能被击败的。当周围的水位开始上涨，空气开始闪烁微光，你感到她漆黑的目光洞穿了你，让你很不自在。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3e64af43fc0fbecfa4c004c9f2fcdd6479853573b82f958ce08ea8f04f5cb6d6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"992fdf7555d28ab707bc336f1abddac8de656da653dfd89d810a45e2859f8a00","logical_entry_identity":"63d53f6b7ba7b768482afdf91e8c1db250cf08adba14e7a5975d08e217057f08","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Orb Of Thaumaturgy","source_tag":"_t","target":"奇术之球"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dfc4a57f99a7aefec75a13c3cb3b9341eaf818b49e3640dc26601d9e0f19a527","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9930b8a77648b69ef3fea2dd3dd8d5f33745d84994dbe5c7bff9b3ff95169f12","logical_entry_identity":"1afa71efb6d375c51d9f966d0cf1b517edd58822a979698d6296a0d84365f056","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Cannot heal higher than %d life.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"受到治疗时，生命值维持在 %d 点以下。"},{"args_order":null,"call_